Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,417.6)}{\an7}Yuzawaya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this is where you go to get fabric!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming with me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm club president.\NI'm happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what I want to do for my next costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping to get inspired by some of\Nthe fabrics and materials we see here today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a cool way of figuring things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:11.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,403.2)}{\an7}Can We Be Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never been to this kind of store before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, they have a whole cosplay section!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.17,0:02:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course!\NLots of their customers are cosplayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:29.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,295.2)}{\an7}Made with cosplay materials!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,People make those from scratch, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Props are a must-have for fighter\Ncharacters or battleship girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll restock on my Liliel cosplay basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can go hang out somewhere if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you want me to carry anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll need this, and this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,These have gotta be heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's more what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can hold it for you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-maybe I shouldn't have just grabbed\Nit out of her hands... Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Off-white stretch fabric and pink PVC...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Wait, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ohmigosh, did she figure it out from the fabric alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fifth...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you No-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.88,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,86.4)}{\an7}RRRRUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please don't be a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:08.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cinderella Stars Cosplay Event?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you going to this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want me to go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what's that you have there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nonoa, as in the fourth place on that ranking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she invited you to this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think she wants me to come see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it didn't feel friendly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,She mentioned the ranking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was a challenge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:05:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So she wants you to compete\Nwith her at this event, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I don't think she likes me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't jump to conclusions!\NYou don't know if that's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know why she'd be going after you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was ranked higher, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe she wants to take me\Nout before I get too powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't really know what she's thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna take her up on it, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to believe all cosplayers\Nare friends and allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I have to go!\NI'm sure she's a good person, deep down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get that. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But how are you gonna cosplay at the event?\NLiliel isn't in Cinderella Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, how forgetful you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you remember why you have Cinderella Stars\Ninstalled when you don't even play it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know what my next cosplay is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, can you even finish in time?\NThe event is next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, uh, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-the avatar of Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You coulda just told me it was a rhetorical question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm gonna get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,See, I'm okay. I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll wear Coulia again to the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could get her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:07:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could get her to be my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's what happened today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,When someone helped me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank him,\Nbut instead just glared at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why am I like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:18.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So depressing? So antisocial?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I started cosplaying to make friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I was too nervous to say anything,\Nlet alone connect with any other cosplayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to smile,\Nbut I probably made everyone think I'm stuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I took a big leap forward today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I ran into Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She caught me off-guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,but giving her that flyer turned\Nout to be the perfect move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she took it from me!\NMy invitation! My love letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might actually make my first-ever friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today's event isn't centered around cosplay, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's for the first\Nanniversary of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they have a cosplay area set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for spending your Sunday with us, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, especially when you suddenly give\Nme a week's notice to go to an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being an advisor sure is hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that a new camera?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously buy a camera that's\Nbetter than the one we have in our club?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Behold, the power of a public servant's credit limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's actually here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-how do I play this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Say something. Say hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Three, two, o-o-o-one...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.04,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,288)}{\an7}RRRRUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm freaking her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm some weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to say something,\Nor she won't like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'm too scared I'll say something stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nonoa-chan, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to screw things up anyways,\Nmaybe I shouldn't say anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did I run away?!\NI'm being weird again! I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess she doesn't like me after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan just started,\Nbut she already has friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san! What cosplay is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Nagomi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hi, K-Kai-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The name's Okumura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've still got terrible fashion sense, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This outfit is cute- wait, Mayura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.21,Q5,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san and Mayura-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,This outfit is cute- wait, Mayura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're Heavenly Queens!\NEven I've heard of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So how do you guys know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, she's my Sensei at-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm keeping this a secret at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so keep the school stuff a secret out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's your Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!\NShe's my apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No wonder I thought of Mayura\Nthe second I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That must mean you're endorsing\NLiliel to take your throne when you retire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great. Now she's going to spread\Nthat rumor like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you cosplaying here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know it! I'm an official guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm booked at basically all the events in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet you're thinking how\Nannoying that's gonna be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, then, I won't bother saying hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I'll get to see you at every single cosplay event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is she so goddamn adorable?! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get to see her more often than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why're you bragging about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:21.54,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,86.4)}{\an7}WOBBLE\N{\pos(102.4,136.8)}{\an7}WOBBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't win. Her friends are too cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We won't get along.\NShe'll never be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's pretty surprising how\Nmany people are here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kai-sama is talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,For an event that's not cosplay-centric,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:36.58,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,216)}{\an7}COSPLAYER CHECK-IN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,there sure are a lot of\Ncosplayers and photographers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because I'm here as a guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding, geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gotta be here for her.\NSee them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the Coulia fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about the Five Rising Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, the first two they posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, did she invite you to this event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, kinda?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,She challenged me to a duel, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,A duel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Another cosplayer picked a fight with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know I'm the last one to talk, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you were picking a fight with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,there are tons of cosplayers out there\Nwho see everyone as a rival to compete with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean, like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that friendly rivalry's part of the fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't deny that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Especially since you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that look for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember my newbie days now! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.38,Q5,,0,0,0,,She's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember my newbie days now! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish we could be friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-oh, no, they totally have the wrong idea!\NI made the worst first impression ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can be friends now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I should just give up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noa-chan, this is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You drew Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so good! Draw me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.33,Q5,,0,0,0,,When I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so good! Draw me next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:06.96,Q5,,0,0,0,,I could make friends just by doing what I liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't weird.\NLittle kids are all otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, while all the normal kids figured that out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I completely missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:20.67,Q8,,0,0,0,,Noa-chan's drawing stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I completely missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:21.42,Q9,,0,0,0,,Noa-chan's drawing stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:23.71,Q9,,0,0,0,,Does she ever study for tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:25.33,Q9,,0,0,0,,You're quitting the baseball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.92,Q8,,0,0,0,,I gotta study.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And while everyone grew out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And while everyone grew out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I stayed an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noa, why aren't you studying?!\NStop wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that!\NYou're not a little kid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should we do for the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do a ParaDol group!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be Suffy-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope I've got some PTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So there are adults who have friends\Nthey can enjoy their hobbies with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on. I can't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up the things I like!\NI want to be proud of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I want friends who feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give it one more try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I put all my effort into the things I love,\Nmaybe I can make a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cosplayed for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The girl in the mirror felt like another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel weird at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt like I could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could even make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But my first event was a total bust.\NMaybe I'm not cut out for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,A Liliel? Nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's probably loved her favorite\Nseries for a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet just talking to her would make me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:23.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could get her to be my friend,\NI'd be so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today's the day!\NI'm going to make a change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make my first friend ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've been waiting for,\NCinderella Star fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Introducing our special guest, Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san is headed to the photo area now,\Nso we hope you'll see her there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel, we're not competing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't need to try\Nand outshine each other at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.96,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,64.8)}{\an7}RUUUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I won't complain if I come out on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san is really fired up today, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's regained her confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That posture says she thinks\Nshe's the cutest one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This might be her most powerful form yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope Ririsa's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:26.92,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,352.8)}{\an7}Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's taking a while to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we check on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's packed in here! Look at all the idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta clear things up with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That spot's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.63,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,57.6)}{\an7}GLARE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go ahead! I'll go change in that corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I screwed up again. That's three in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.25,0:16:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll try again after I get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll feel different once I'm in costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's Liliel-chan going to wear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think of that when\NI invited her out to this event!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought she was so cool for cosplaying Liliel,\Nand now I'm making her do something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she really put together a\NCinderella Stars cosplay in a whole week?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I told her to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the worst. My heart hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I've seen her cosplay,\Nbut who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've already seen her costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She came crying to me yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.54,Q5,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I helped her finish her costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how she got it done in a week!\NYou're too nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but her costume looks clean as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Asking a Heavenly Queen is cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never thought she'd do\Nsomeone who wasn't Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I almost want to ask if she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's more than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:17:59.13,Q5,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:17:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's more than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:17:59.79,Q5,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:17.75,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,57.6)}{\an7}Angel Liliel On Stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course Shonen Jump has a\Ncollab with Cinderella Stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your girl's in everything, geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Humanity is in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and only one angel can teach\Nthem how to work together:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,when she's reborn in the modern age and\Nstarts a singing career in this idol AU!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The app developers totally\Nunderstood the source material!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have money to pay\Nfor premium gacha odds,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I played all through class and got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love that you're dedicated,\Nbut save some dedication for school, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This skirt's a lot shorter than usual, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got bloomers on, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't need to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan is so freaking cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so cool that Liliel's in Cinderella Stars, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, please let this happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We could take pictures together,\Nside-by-side!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And then we could talk about doing\Na group cosplay from her anime next...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'll do whatever goes best with Liliel!\NAngel, demon, whatever she wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then we'll go out in cosplay together\Nand everyone will love us...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's that Liliel cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coulia's here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you read Mr. Camera's post?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe two of his\NRising Stars are here to battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't want this to be a battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be weird for me\Nto say something to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just summon up your courage and say,\N"Hello, want to take pictures together?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-oh, damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a face-off! A cosplay face-off, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers don't do face-offs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to take pictures together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if I tried, they'd just get the\Nwrong idea about Liliel-chan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should go-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you like to take pictures with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, did she just ask if\NI want to take pictures with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way, she'd never ask someone like me to do that.\NI must have imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She straight-up ignored Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! I wasted my one and only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I made Liliel-chan look like an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to turn around...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's getting crowded.\NLet's find a spot and get things started!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why am I like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I tried to say something,\Nbut it felt like the words were caught in my throat...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd all be better off if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nonoa-chan, could I get a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to get my picture taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I came here to be friends with Liliel-chan.\NNow there's no point in me being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's weird. I used to be able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.63,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,280.8)}{\an7}ANIME CLUB
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So my headcanon is that Himari-chan was\Nworried about the age gap between her and Raia,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that's why she didn't-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:36.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, Noa-chan, you like,\Nonly talk about stuff you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. I could go on forever about manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, you just keep rambling,\Nand don't even try to connect it with our conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like you don't even listen to us.\NConversation's supposed to go back-and-forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet instead of listening,\Nyou're just planning out what you wanna say next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not communication, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd all be better off if you didn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,People hate it when I talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm weird when I talk.\NI'm the same as I was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay didn't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:24:00.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,388.8)}{\an7}Together with You
